### Default window (28 days)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/pageviews/stats

### 90-day window
GET http://localhost:7071/api/pageviews/stats?days=90

### 180-day window
GET http://localhost:7071/api/pageviews/stats?days=180

### Invalid days value (expect 28-day window)
GET http://localhost:7071/api/pageviews/stats?days=7
